# Resume versioning

- Quality baseline is `resumes/base/JZ_resume.tex` — do not dilute specificity.
- Active clusters are `*_v1.1` under `cloud_swe` / `data_ml` / `health_ai` (also linked from `resumes/clusters/`).
- Record exact `resume_version` after every apply.
- Broad: cluster resume; Core: light tailor; deep tailor rare.
- Every version change needs a hypothesis in `data/resume_versions.csv`.
